      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If this ends up being implemented, it has to be optional. Some people (index users) will most likely rebind everything away from thumbstick click (because clicking them is a surefire way to RMA the controllers in three months), so menu will be opened by a different button without thumbstick touch input being registered.",
