      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d359d69973cc81d91d41ee4|full_name}: Yep, it definitely needs to be optional. But it could also be activated by eg right thumbstick up or something as well to avoid wear from clicking.",
      "viewerReactions": null
